      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON FREDDIE (1) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at this track over 520m behind Starlight Tory (30.71) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Has ability and looks hard to stop. SILENT ASSASSIN (8) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 4 length second (30.25) over 520m at this track. Can feature again. ROSIE BROWNE (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (30.46) at this track behind Aston Ruler in a Other. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Hard to beat again. TAKE MY ADVICE (7) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
